      '➖ Implemented a PWA for p2p betting on the XRP Ledger network and developed an administrative panel for payment verification and user transactions.',
      '➖ Implementation of a web app for searching for bets placed on the XRPL blockchain, with a backoffice and APIs for user management, statistics, and more.',
      '➖ Collaborate in the implementation of a web application for location-based tracking of potentially infected and already infected individuals with COVID-19.',
      '➖ Collaborate in the implementation of a web app (frontend and backend) for online roulette game interaction for the Cammegh company.',
      '➖ Collaborated on the implementation and maintenance of a desktop and mobile wallet based on the Cryptocurrency Casinocoin and Crazy8Token.',
      '➖ Created a library for internal project management with an administrative panel for user and transaction verification.',
      '➖ Implemented a PWA using blockchain powered by CasinoCoin to verify and store casino spins and bets in real-time on the XRP Ledger network (TrustTracker™).',
      '➖ Software development, research, support and bug fixing, source code management, and documentation. Server installation and maintenance.',
